# Dance Maniax 2nd Mix (G*A39 VER. JAA), Konami 2000: a game, from what dmx2m-install left (its NVRAM).
# Power-on: MUSIC INITIALIZING, the loading, the title by frame ~4500. Two coins at 6000, then Start
# every 300 frames through the caution, HOW TO PLAY and COURSE SELECT (its default, Moon course:
# three tracks played without a break); the course played by breaking all four of player 1's
# sensors every 8 frames from 7900: its first track, PETIT LOVE, then CAT'S EYE (Ventura Mix) begins by ~13200.
# Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames, to compare HIRAKU's 573 core with
# MAME through a song.
game dmx2m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 6000 press "Coin 1" 8
at 6040 press "Coin 1" 8
at 6300 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 6600 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 6900 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 7200 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 7500 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 7800 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 7900 every 8 press "P1 D-Sensor U L" 4
from 7902 every 8 press "P1 D-Sensor U R" 4
from 7904 every 8 press "P1 D-Sensor D0 L" 4
from 7904 every 8 press "P1 D-Sensor D1 L" 4
from 7906 every 8 press "P1 D-Sensor D0 R" 4
from 7906 every 8 press "P1 D-Sensor D1 R" 4
from 0 every 60 snap
at 13500 quit
